      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 357313892532197023, guid: 5f263dfd62bfa0545be704bdf4a73a40, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: react
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: talker
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: changes.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Oh hey, there's something I've been meaning to ask.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: What is it, young lady?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: These coins that I am collecting... what are they for?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: I'm getting a bunch of them. Is there a shop in this world or something?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Ah... no there is no shop, and there is nothing for you to use the coins
        on.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: So then what's the point of the coins?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[6]'
      value: They're used to guide you. Seeing coins means you're going in the right
        way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[7]'
      value: Plus, you're jumping around like a platformer, and what good platformer
        doesn't have collectables?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lines.Array.data[8]'
      value: ...sure, I guess.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'changes.Array.data[1]'
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3599949493136733232, guid: a310180629dcc7c45a5144e04a09cef7, type: 3}
